# Incident checklist

Each line comes from something that went wrong. The review packet gives this list to the reviewers. Add a line after something goes wrong.

| Trigger: what in a change shows the risk | Check: what to look for | Origin: what went wrong, and when |
|---|---|---|
| Example: a change touches how dates are stored | Dates saved before the change still read the same | Example: dates moved by one day, March last year |
